  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated lifesaving multi-sectoral conflict response In the Oromia region (Envelope 1 , Conflict response West Wellega)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a multi-sectoral life-saving response, for conflict-displaced communities in 6 woredas of Wellega ( Kiltu Kara , Mana Sibu and Nejo ).  Save the children in collaboration with its local partner aims to provide integrated Health, Nutrition , WASH, Protection , Education and Shelter activities to respond to the current high need on the ground.</narrative>
  </description>
